# ── Environment Variables ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set this in Railway → Service → Variables (not committed to git)

# TRW_COOKIES
# A JSON array of cookie objects exported from your browser.
#
# HOW TO EXPORT:
# 1. Log in to app.jointherealworld.com in Chrome
# 2. Open DevTools (F12) → Application tab → Cookies → app.jointherealworld.com
# 3. Install the browser extension "EditThisCookie" or "Cookie-Editor"
#    (Cookie-Editor: https://cookie-editor.cgagnier.ca/)
# 4. Click Export → "Export as JSON"
# 5. Paste the entire JSON array as the value of TRW_COOKIES in Railway
#
# The value will look like:
# [{"name":"session","value":"abc123","domain":"app.jointherealworld.com",...}, ...]
#
TRW_COOKIES=
